<title>NETHERLANDS: NBM-Amstelland results per division.</title>
<headline>NBM-Amstelland results per division.</headline>
<dateline>THE HAGUE 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>NBM Amstelland turnover per division, full-year 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Project development and property  370.0  vs 321.0</p>
<p>    Building and infrastructure (bln)   1.87 vs   1.67</p>
<p>    Wholesaling			     625.0  vs 293.0</p>
<p>    Retail				    259.0  vs 157.0</p>
<p>    Industry (brickworks, etc	   580.0  vs 176.0</p>
<p>Other activities after subtraction</p>
<p>    of inter-group turnover	     -14.0  vs -126.0</p>
<p>Operating profit per division, full year 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Project development and property  13.2   vs  15.7</p>
<p>    Building and infrastructure	 15.4   vs   4.7</p>
<p>    Wholesaling			     45.8   vs  14.4</p>
<p>    Retail				    19.9   vs  12.2</p>
<p>    Industry				  65.2   vs  26.4</p>
<p>    Total				    159.5   vs  73.4</p>
<p>    Group costs and other activities -23.7   vs  -8.8</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     135.8   vs  64.6</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
